{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Think about sudoku, but reinvented!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has just a few simple rules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to fill a 4x5 grid with numbers from 1 to 5, ensuring that each row and column won't have duplicates and that the sum of each row\u2019s numbers gives the result on their right side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you must insert all five numbers (1,2,3,4,5) into the two colored sections on the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle has a unique solution. It's relaxing, but still pretty challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to spice up the challenge, play \u2022 zenku \u2022 in YinYang mode and complete the puzzles within 2 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you complete all 100 zenku puzzles?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank Eno (aka XSGames) is an indie puzzle game dev from Italy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow @xsgames_ on both X and Instagram</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628120?t=1751522075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628120?t=1751522075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628120/a599b9556f4e6bb1a8d5fe363e8c30123ff19886/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751522075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628120/a599b9556f4e6bb1a8d5fe363e8c30123ff19886/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751522075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Think about sudoku, but reinvented!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has just a few simple rules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to fill a 4x5 grid with numbers from 1 to 5, ensuring that each row and column won't have duplicates and that the sum of each row\u2019s numbers gives the result on their right side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you must insert all five numbers (1,2,3,4,5) into the two colored sections on the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle has a unique solution. It's relaxing, but still pretty challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to spice up the challenge, play \u2022 zenku \u2022 in YinYang mode and complete the puzzles within 2 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you complete all 100 zenku puzzles?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank Eno (aka XSGames) is an indie puzzle game dev from Italy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow @xsgames_ on both X and Instagram</p>","developers":["XSGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628120/8c13c283d2f31d043deb6c18da5d41e9e6e53fbd/header.jpg?t=1751522075","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 XSGames. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15, or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel x86 + Apple silicon (64bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card with 5